  "description": "2dog command-line tool and project templates. `dnx 2dog new MyGame` interactively creates a Godot project with .NET hosts; `2dog add` adds hosts (desktop, browser-wasm, xUnit, WinForms, WinUI 3, Avalonia) to an existing one; every prompt has a flag, so `2dog new MyGame --desktop --tests` runs unattended. `2dog pack list` inspects an exported .pck. `dotnet new install 2dog` provides the `dotnet new 2dog` project template. The engine library itself is the 2dog.engine package.",
